cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below and credit the sources: Correspondances gare-bus : Train Nomade (https://trainnomade.fr), d'après les horaires des réseaux publiés sur transport.data.gouv.fr."
type: dataset
title: "Bus, tram and coach connections at French railway stations: stops within 350 m, lines and typical times"
abstract: >-
  For the railway stations covered by Train Nomade, every bus, tram, metro or coach stop within 350 m of
  the station, with its lines, directions, first and last departure on a working day, daytime frequency and
  number of departures on a working day, a Saturday and a Sunday, from the GTFS timetables published by the
  local networks on transport.data.gouv.fr. Updated every week. Live file:
  https://api.trainnomade.fr/donnees/v1/correspondances-gares.csv
authors:
  - name: "Train Nomade"
    email: contact@trainnomade.fr
    website: "https://trainnomade.fr"
version: "2026-10-25"
date-released: "2026-10-25"
license: ODbL-1.0
url: "https://trainnomade.fr/donnees/correspondances-gares/"
repository: "https://www.data.gouv.fr/organizations/train-nomade/"
keywords:
  - bus
  - tram
  - coach
  - railway station
  - connections
  - GTFS
  - public transport
  - France
  - open data
references:
  - type: data
    title: "Point d'accès national aux données de mobilité"
    authors:
      - name: "transport.data.gouv.fr"
    url: "https://transport.data.gouv.fr/"
